<title>UK: Sigma Finance sets $200 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sigma Finance sets $200 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIGMA FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    03.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0555  PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.868    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
